    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Stunning two-bedroom second-floor apartment overlooking beautifully maintained communal grounds and the River Liffey, offering a peaceful setting in a highly desirable location.\r\n\r\nThe property comprises a welcoming entrance hall with laminate flooring, a storage cupboard and hot press. To the left is the modern family bathroom with tiled flooring and modern sanitary ware. Adjacent is the spacious main double bedroom, filled with natural light and featuring comfortable carpeted flooring with built in wardrobes. The second bedroom also has carpeted floors, built in wardrobes and offers excellent flexibility as a home office.\r\nThe hallway continues to the separate kitchen, which provides ample countertop and cupboard space, tiled flooring and a tiled splashback. At the end of the hallway is the bright and spacious living and dining area featuring laminate floors. This space is ideal for both relaxing and entertaining.\r\nThe living room opens onto a generous northwest-facing balcony with plenty of room for outdoor seating. Overlooking the beautifully maintained communal grounds, it provides a peaceful space to relax.\r\n\r\nBellevue is ideally located close to Phoenix Park, the Memorial Gardens and a great selection of local shops, cafés, restaurants and bars. Dublin City Centre is also easily accessible via Dublin Bus."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Spacious and bright second-floor apartment\r\nSeparate kitchen with ample storage\r\nBright living and dining area\r\nNorthwest-facing balcony\r\nViews of the River Liffey & Memorial Gardens\r\nLift access\r\nBuilt in 2002\r\nNo rent cap\r\nClose to Phoenix Park and Dublin City Centre"
      },
